{"symbol":"ALM.MC","area":"europe","updated":"2026-11-16T19:18:06Z","info":{"address1":"Ronda General Mitre, 151","city":"Barcelona","zip":"08022","country":"Spain","phone":"34 93 291 30 00","website":"https://www.almirall.com","industry":"Drug Manufacturers - Specialty & Generic","industryKey":"drug-manufacturers-specialty-generic","industryDisp":"Drug Manufacturers - Specialty & Generic","sector":"Healthcare","sectorKey":"healthcare","sectorDisp":"Healthcare","longBusinessSummary":"Almirall, S.A. operates as a skin health-focused biopharmaceutical company in Spain, Europe, the Middle East, the United States, Asia, and Africa. The company offers its products for skin diseases comprising Psoriasis, atopic dermatitis, acne, actinic keratosis, onychomycosis, androgenic alopecia, oncodermatology, and orphan indications, as well as for alimentary tract and metabolism, anti-infective for systemic use, cardiovascular system, dermatological, genito urinary system and sex hormones, immunostimulants, metabolism, musculo-skeletal system, nervous system, respiratory system, systemic hormonal preparations. It also develops tirbanibulin for actinic keratosis, and tildrakizumab for psoriatic arthritis under the registration phase, as well as lebrikizumab for atopic dermatitis pediatric in phase 2; Anti-IL-1RAP mAb for hidradenitis suppurativa, anti-IL-1RAP mAb for inflammatory skin disease, Anti-IL-21 mAb for hidradenitis suppurativa, IL-2muFc for alopecia areata, IL-2muFc for atopic dermatitis, and IL-2muFc for inflammatory skin disease in phase 2; readthrough inducer for rare dermatology in phase 1; and anti-IL-13/OX40L BsAb for atopic dermatitis, SMOL oral for Th2-driven diseases, and mRNA/LNP for non-melanoma skin cancer in preclinical stage. It has research and development agreements with Evotec, Ichnos, Simcere, Etherna, Novo Nordisk, and Eloxx. The company was formerly known as Laboratorios Almirall, S.A. and changed its name to Almirall, S.A. in May 2009. Almirall, S.A. was founded in 1943 and is headquartered in Barcelona, Spain.","fullTimeEmployees":2108,"companyOfficers":[{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Carlos  Gallardo Piqué","age":53,"title":"CEO, Member of Management Board & Chairman of the Board","yearBorn":1972,"fiscalYear":2015,"totalPay":50000,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Jon U. Garay Alonso","age":52,"title":"CFO & Member of Management Board","yearBorn":1973,"fiscalYear":2015,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Eloi  Crespo Cervera","title":"Chief Industrial Operations Officer & Member of Management Board","fiscalYear":2015,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Esteve  Conesa Panicot","title":"Chief People & Culture Officer and Member of Management Board","fiscalYear":2015,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Dr. Volker  Koscielny","title":"Chief Medical Officer & Member of Management Board","fiscalYear":2015,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Dr. Karl  Ziegelbauer","title":"Chief Scientific Officer & Member of Management Board","fiscalYear":2015,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Ms. Isabel Cristina Gomes","title":"Company Vice Secretary,Chief Legal Officer, General Counsel & Member of Management Board","fiscalYear":2015,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Paul  Rittman","title":"Member of Management Board and President & GM of Almirall US","fiscalYear":2015,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Ms. Lidia Martin Pereda","title":"Chief Commercial Officer of Europe & International and Member of Management Board","fiscalYear":2015,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Pablo Divasson del Fraile","title":"Senior Director of Investor Relations","fiscalYear":2015,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0}],"auditRisk":2,"boardRisk":3,"compensationRisk":1,"shareHolderRightsRisk":3,"overallRisk":1